H46 item 4 ("+text") integration for trainer-lane (research/H46_lm_and_text/README.md, amendment 3).
Applies on top of lane branch h46/lm, which adds python/ultra/train/text_tables.py and
python/ultra/tests/test_text_tables.py. Apply from the repo root with: patch -p1 < this file.

What the diff below does (asr.py, mwer.py, beam.py):
  * ModelConfig gains pred_text_tables (default False) and pred_text_dim (64). With the flag on,
    ASRModel builds train.text_tables.TextPredictor (dense path = pred_ctx tokens, tables over
    the last 4), and every context builder reads predictor.context_len instead of cfg.pred_ctx.
  * With the flag off, nothing changes. With it on and the model initialised from B0
    (load_state_dict(strict=False): only predictor.text.* missing), pred_p and every loss equal
    B0's exactly (checked on a small config).

Trainer hook for trainer.py (trainer-lane's file; not part of the diff). Suggested TrainConfig
fields: text_weight: float = 0.0, text_batch: int = 8192, text_stream: str = "" (a
`python -m train.nlm tokens` train.u16, e.g. sha256 8e249254...), text_enull_batches: int = 250.
  setup (rank 0 computes, all ranks load the same tensor):
      from train.text_tables import TextStream, mean_enc_proj
      self._text = TextStream(cfg.text_stream, model.predictor.context_len, seed=cfg.seed + rank)
      self._e_null = mean_enc_proj(model, first cfg.text_enull_batches TRAIN batches)  # save it
  init from B0: model.predictor.load_plain(b0_predictor_state) (or strict=False as above)
  in train_step, after `loss = out["loss"]` and before backward:
      if self.cfg.text_weight > 0:
          from train.text_tables import text_loss
          ctx_t, tgt_t = self._text.batch(self.cfg.text_batch)
          lt = text_loss(self.model.predictor, self.model.joiner, ctx_t.to(self.device),
                         tgt_t.to(self.device), self._e_null)
          loss = loss + self.cfg.text_weight * lt   # under DDP: before the gradient sync
          out["text"] = lt
Arms, gate and kill rule: amendment 3 (T0 continuation control, T1 tables + text 0.3, T1a
tables only; seeds 1234 / 4321; > 2x the four-run spread against T0 on both seeds).

